## Third-party tools

Cangmo is built with the Cangjie compiler, runtime and standard library,
which are used as an installed toolchain under the Apache License 2.0 with
Runtime Library Exception. The operating system CNG API (`bcrypt.dll`) is
called for PBKDF2 and CSPRNG. No third-party source code is vendored into
this repository.

See [LICENSE](LICENSE) and [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

